            "review_title": "Review at Hải Sản Thanh Sương 2",
            "review_text": "Lawrence L\nSingapore, Singapore207 contributions\n0\nGood food but poor hygiene and too much sand on the outdoor dining tables.\nJul 2026 • Friends\nWe were a large group of 10 diners and it was our first time to this beach front restaurant based on a recommendation. We sat outdoors on the beach, as the restaurant’s indoor seating was full. The seafood with fish, lobsters, clams and prawns were fresh and good flavors. The Service staff were prompt and attentive. Our two negative feedback were: poor hygiene as utensils, plates and bowls on the table were dusty due to the sand blown from the beach, and the high noise levels from other diners given the close proximity of dining tables. on the beach.\nRead more\nWritten July 10, 2026",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-11",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
