            "review_text": "Urszula H\n11 contributions\n0\nTotally bad\nAug 2024 • Couples\nHi, we’ve really bad experience with the restaurant .First they told us we could pay with credit cards. Then they gave us unteasonable bill for like 7.000.000 and we had credit card that they was not able to check because their system wasnot working. We wanted to pay in usd, so theygave us course like 2000000 per 100 usd what was without any sense. So it was 3 times more expensive than in the sheraton hotel for lobsters , then cheating rating for usd and they didn’t have terminal for cards as they told us. So we are not satisfied with this at all. \nWe we would like to aware all tourist about these sihity place !!!!\nRead more\nWritten August 16, 2024",
