            "review_text": "kenkeh\nSubang Jaya, Malaysia4323 contributions\n0\nHidden Gem seafood\nJul 2024 • Family\nI highly recommend this seafood restaurant, it’s yummy and seafood was fresh , recommended by Nha Trang locals and saw lots of Vietnamese here which is good 👍🏻 , we ordered the Fresh lobster 1 million vnd per 1kg , they cooked it half butter garlic and the other cheese flavor , omg it’s yummy 😋, honest restaurant with price tag , they weight in front of you and write it in a piece of paper what you ordered in grams , love the sea grapes salad , seafood porridge was so good that we ordered 2 more bowls again , the way they fried the garlic was so crunchy and tasty , This restaurant is for keeps , will definitely visit back again in future !\nRead more\nWritten July 3, 2024",
